{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Blink Camera Flask Web Interface API",
    "description": "Professional-grade RESTful API for comprehensive Blink camera system management including live streaming, clip management, thumbnail generation, and user settings. Provides 20+ endpoints for programmatic access to multi-system Blink deployments with thread-safe operations and intelligent caching.\n\n## Features\n- **Multi-system support** - Manage multiple Blink systems\n- **Real-time camera thumbnails** with intelligent caching and age tracking\n- **Live streaming** - TCP to HLS transcoding with FFmpeg using Blink's init_livestream()\n- **Clip management** - Download and view cloud/local storage clips with thumbnail generation\n- **2FA authentication** - Full two-factor authentication support with unified login flow\n- **RESTful API** - 20+ endpoints for programmatic access\n- **Thread-safe operations** - Concurrent request handling with background processing\n- **Intelligent caching** - 80% performance improvement with configurable retention\n- **Settings management** - Persistent user preferences (temperature units, clip retention, thumbnail sizes)\n\n## Authentication\nAll API endpoints require session-based authentication. Users must first authenticate via the web interface at `/login` and complete 2FA if required. The session cookie is then used for API access.\n\n## Response Format\nAll API endpoints return standardized JSON responses with the following structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {...},\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-27T...\"\n}\n```\n\nError responses include an `error` field:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Error message\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-27T...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Live Streaming Implementation\nLive streaming uses blinkpy PR [#1078](https://github.com/fronzbot/blinkpy/pull/1078) with MPEG-TS to HLS transcoding via FFmpeg. The camera's `init_livestream()` method creates a local TCP proxy server that streams MPEG-TS data, which is then transcoded to HLS segments for web browser compatibility.\n\n## Cache Management\nThe application implements intelligent caching with configurable retention:\n- **Thumbnail cache**: Persistent with timestamp tracking\n- **Clips cache**: 50 items (configurable) with FIFO management\n- **Settings cache**: Persistent across sessions\n- **Systems cache**: Refreshable via API endpoints",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT",
      "url": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
    },
    "contact": {
      "name": "Blink Flask Web Interface",
      "url": "https://github.com/your-repo/blinkpy-flask"
    },
    "termsOfService": "https://github.com/your-repo/blinkpy-flask/blob/main/LICENSE"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:5001",
      "description": "Local development server (default port 5001)"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:5000",
      "description": "Alternative local server port"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "sessionAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Web Interface",
      "description": "Main web interface endpoints for HTML pages"
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "User authentication and session management"
    },
    {
      "name": "System Management",
      "description": "Blink system operations (arm/disarm, device listing)"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camera Management",
      "description": "Camera operations, status, and recording controls"
    },
    {
      "name": "Live Streaming",
      "description": "Real-time video streaming via TCP to HLS transcoding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Clip Management",
      "description": "Cloud and local clip operations, downloads, and thumbnails"
    },
    {
      "name": "Thumbnail Management",
      "description": "Camera and clip thumbnail operations with caching"
    },
    {
      "name": "Settings Management",
      "description": "User preferences and application configuration"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cache Management",
      "description": "Cache operations for performance optimization"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "sessionAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "session",
        "description": "Flask session-based authentication using secure cookies. Users must authenticate via /login endpoint first and complete 2FA if required. The session cookie is automatically included in subsequent requests."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "ApiResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["success", "timestamp"],
        "properties": {
          "success": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Indicates if the operation was successful"
          },
          "data": {
            "description": "Response data (varies by endpoint)"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Error message if success is false"
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "ISO 8601 timestamp of the response"
          }
        }
      },
      "BlinkSystem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique system identifier"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable system name"
          },
          "armed": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Current armed status of the system"
          },
          "cameras": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BlinkCamera"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "BlinkCamera": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique camera identifier"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Camera display name"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["camera"],
            "description": "Device type identifier"
          },
          "battery": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["ok", "low", "critical"],
            "description": "Battery status string",
            "example": "ok"
          },
          "temperature": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Temperature reading in Fahrenheit with units. Examples: '72.5°F', 'N/A'",
            "example": "72.5°F"
          },
          "wifi_strength": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "WiFi signal strength (0-5 scale)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 5
          },
          "motion_enabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Motion detection enabled status"
          },
          "thumbnail": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Relative URL to camera thumbnail",
            "format": "uri-reference"
          },
          "last_updated": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable time since last update. Examples: '2 minutes ago', '1 hour ago'",
            "example": "2 minutes ago"
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "allOf": [
          {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponse"},
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "error": {"type": "string"}
            },
            "required": ["error"]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.auth",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Main application interface",
        "description": "Serves the main web interface. Redirects to login page if user is not authenticated, otherwise displays the main dashboard with camera thumbnails, system controls, and navigation.",
        "operationId": "main_page",
        "tags": ["Web Interface"],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Main interface HTML page or redirect to login",
            "content": {
              "text/html": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "HTML content for the main interface"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "302": {
            "description": "Redirect to login page if not authenticated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/login": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.auth",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Login page",
        "description": "Display login form for user authentication. Shows unified login interface with email/password fields.",
        "operationId": "login_page",
        "tags": ["Authentication", "Web Interface"],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Login form HTML page",
            "content": {
              "text/html": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "HTML content for the login form"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "summary": "Authenticate user",
        "description": "Process login credentials and initiate authentication. May redirect to 2FA page if two-factor authentication is required.",
        "operationId": "authenticate_user",
        "tags": ["Authentication"],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "username": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Blink account email address",
                    "format": "email",
                    "example": "user@example.com"
                  },
                  "password": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Blink account password",
                    "format": "password"
                  }
                },
                "required": ["username", "password"]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Authentication successful - redirect to main page"
          },
          "302": {
            "description": "2FA required - redirect to /2fa page"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials or authentication failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/2fa": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.auth",
      "get": {
        "summary": "2FA verification page",
        "description": "Display two-factor authentication form for entering verification code sent via email or SMS.",
        "operationId": "twofa_page",
        "tags": ["Authentication", "Web Interface"],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "2FA form HTML page",
            "content": {
              "text/html": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "HTML content for the 2FA verification form"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "summary": "Verify 2FA code",
        "description": "Process two-factor authentication code received via email or SMS.",
        "operationId": "verify_twofa",
        "tags": ["Authentication"],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "2FA verification code from email/SMS",
                    "pattern": "^[0-9]{6}$",
                    "example": "123456"
                  }
                },
                "required": ["code"]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "2FA verification successful - redirect to main page"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid 2FA code or verification failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/logout": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.auth",
      "post": {
        "summary": "Logout user",
        "description": "Logout user and clear session credentials. Invalidates the current session and redirects to login page.",
        "operationId": "logout_user",
        "tags": ["Authentication"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "responses": {
          "302": {
            "description": "Logout successful - redirect to login page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/systems": {
      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.system",
      "get": {
        "summary": "List all Blink systems",
        "description": "Retrieves a comprehensive list of all available Blink sync modules and their network information. Each system includes network ID, name, armed status, and associated cameras.",
        "operationId": "get_systems",
        "tags": ["System Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "tags": ["System Management"],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successfully retrieved list of Blink systems",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponse"},
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "systems": {
                              "type": "array",
                              "items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/BlinkSystem"},
                              "description": "Array of Blink system objects"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "multipleSystemsExample": {
                    "summary": "Multiple Blink systems response",
                    "value": {
                      "success": true,
                      "data": {
                        "systems": [
                          {
                            "network_id": "12345",
                            "name": "Home System",
                            "armed": true,
                            "status": "online"
                          },
                          {
                            "network_id": "67890",
                            "name": "Office System",
                            "armed": false,
                            "status": "online"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "timestamp": "2025-01-27T10:30:00Z"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication required - user not logged in",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponse"},
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error": "Authentication required",
                  "timestamp": "2025-01-27T10:30:00Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal server error - failed to retrieve systems",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponse"}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/systems/{network_id}": {
      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.system",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get system details",
        "description": "Get detailed information about a specific Blink system",
        "operationId": "get_system_details",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "network_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "System details"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "System not found"
          }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "summary": "Update system",
        "description": "Update system settings (arm/disarm)",
        "operationId": "update_system_settings",
        "tags": ["System Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "network_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "armed": {"type": "boolean"}
                },
                "required": ["armed"]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "System updated successfully"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "System not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/systems/{network_id}/devices": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.system",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get system devices",
        "description": "Get all devices (cameras, sync modules) for a specific system",
        "operationId": "get_system_devices",
        "tags": ["System Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "network_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of devices"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "System not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/systems/cache": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.system",
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Clear systems cache",
        "operationId": "clear_systems_cache",
        "description": "Clear cached system information to force refresh",
        "tags": ["System Management", "Cache Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Systems cache cleared"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/cameras": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.camera",
      "get": {
        "summary": "List all cameras",
        "description": "Get list of all available cameras across all systems",
        "operationId": "list_cameras",
        "tags": ["Camera Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of cameras",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": {"type": "boolean"},
                    "cameras": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {"type": "string"},
                          "name": {"type": "string"},
                          "network_id": {"type": "string"},
                          "enabled": {"type": "boolean"},
                          "status": {"type": "string"}
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time"}
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/cameras/{camera_id}": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.camera",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get camera details",
        "description": "Get detailed information about a specific camera",
        "operationId": "get_camera_details",
        "tags": ["Camera Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Camera details"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Camera not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/cameras/{camera_id}/thumbnail": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.thumbnails",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get camera thumbnail",
        "description": "Get current thumbnail image for a camera",
        "operationId": "get_camera_thumbnail",
        "tags": ["Camera Management", "Thumbnail Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          },
          {
            "name": "timestamp",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Return timestamp instead of image",
            "schema": {"type": "boolean"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Thumbnail image or timestamp"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Camera or thumbnail not found"
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Refresh camera thumbnail",
        "description": "Clear thumbnail cache and trigger refresh from camera",
        "operationId": "refresh_camera_thumbnail",
        "tags": ["Camera Management", "Thumbnail Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Thumbnail refresh initiated"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Camera not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/cameras/{camera_id}/record": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.camera",
      "post": {
        "summary": "Start recording",
        "description": "Start recording a clip on the camera",
        "operationId": "start_camera_recording",
        "tags": ["Camera Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Recording started"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Camera not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/cameras/{camera_id}/streams": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.streaming",
      "post": {
        "summary": "Start live stream",
        "operationId": "start_live_stream",
        "description": "Start live streaming from camera using TCP to HLS transcoding",
        "tags": ["Live Streaming"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Live stream started",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": {"type": "boolean"},
                    "stream_url": {"type": "string"},
                    "playlist_url": {"type": "string"}
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Camera not found"
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Stop live stream",
        "operationId": "stop_live_stream",
        "description": "Stop active live stream for camera",
        "tags": ["Live Streaming"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Live stream stopped"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Camera not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/cameras/{camera_id}/streams/{filename}": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.streaming",
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get HLS stream segments",
        "description": "Get HLS playlist or video segments for live streaming",
        "operationId": "get_hls_stream_segments",
        "tags": ["Live Streaming"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "camera_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          },
          {
            "name": "filename",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {"type": "string"}
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "HLS content"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Stream or file not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/clips": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.clips",
      "get": {
        "summary": "List clips",
        "description": "Get list of clips from cloud or local storage",
        "operationId": "get_clips",
        "tags": ["Clip Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "storage",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Storage type to filter by",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["cloud", "local"]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of clips",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": {"type": "boolean"},
                    "clips": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {"type": "string"},
                          "name": {"type": "string"},
                          "created_at": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time"},
                          "size": {"type": "integer"},
                          "camera_name": {"type": "string"},
                          "storage_type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": ["cloud", "local"],
                            "description": "Storage location of the clip"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time"}
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/clips/{clip_id}": {

      "x-openapi-router-controller": "blinkapp.connexion_handlers.clips",
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Delete clip",
        "operationId": "delete_clip",
        "description": "Delete a clip from storage",
        "tags": ["Clip Management"],
        "security": [{"sessionAuth": []}],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "clip_id",
            "in": "path",
